    ["<DecH>工艺：</> 青藤蔓生\n毒藤缠绕着沉默，暗绿深处藏着致命的优雅。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Green Vine Overgrowth \n Poison vines entwine the silence, and deadly elegance hides in the deep dark green.",
