    ["local coeffData = {\n    [3] = {\n        [3] = {  -- 3非凡\n            baseprice  = 3000000\n        },\n        [2] = {  -- 2非凡+1普通\n            baseprice  = 2000000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1非凡+2普通\n            baseprice  = 500000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 3普通\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        }\n    },\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2非凡\n            baseprice  = 1500000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1非凡+1普通\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2普通\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1非凡\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1普通\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    baseprice = 10000000\nelse\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nreturn Round(baseprice + $4)"] = "local coeffData = {\n    [3] = {\n        [3] = {  -- 3 Beyonder\n            baseprice  = 3000000\n        },\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Beyonder+1 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 2000000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Beyonder+2 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 500000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 3 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        }\n    },\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Beyonder\n            baseprice  = 1500000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Beyonder+1 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Beyonder\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    baseprice = 10000000\nelse\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nreturn Round(baseprice + $4)",
    ["　　她眸中已多了一抹疯狂，看起来用不了多久灵体就会被彻底污染，完全失控。\n　　但是，洛薇雅这一刻的目光里更多是理智和决绝。\n　　她知道自己在做什么，也很清楚自己现在的状态和之后的结局。\n　　呜的风声里，她崩溃的身体连带那阴影“斗篷”落在了“暗天使”萨斯利尔体表。\n　　蠕动的血肉侵蚀了进去，浓厚的阴影飞快扩张，将两道身影一起束缚。\n　　无需洛薇雅开口，科林·伊利亚特已明白了她的意图，当即低沉吼了一声：\n　　“进攻！”\n　　砰！\n　　他的两把晨曦直剑同时斩破虚空，让银白的光芒在纠缠于一的洛薇雅和“暗天使”萨斯利尔身周爆发开来。\n　　笼罩着森然阴影的宫殿一下变亮，布满神圣火焰的巨大光球凭空浮现，将“暗天使”和洛薇雅包容于内，飞快消融着他们，点燃了血肉。\n　　“阳炎”！\n　　这灿烂的光辉里，洛薇雅那双淡灰的眼眸流露出了实质般的痛苦，她的声音虚幻飘渺地回荡了起来：\n　　“我没有背叛白银城……”\n\n　　——第六卷《逐光者》 第一百一十三章 最后的守护"] = "There was already a touch of madness in her eyes, and it looked like it wouldn't be long before her spirit body would be completely corrupted and she would lose control entirely. \n However, in Lovia's gaze at this moment, there was more reason and determination. \n She knew what she was doing, and she was very clear about her current state and her subsequent ending. \n In the howling wind, her collapsing body, along with the shadow \"cloak,\" fell onto the surface of the Dark Angel Sasrir. \n The wriggling flesh and blood eroded into it, and the thick shadows expanded rapidly, binding the two figures together. \n Without needing Lovia to speak, Colin Iliad already understood her intention and immediately roared in a low voice: \n \"Attack!\" \n Bang! \n His two Dawn Greatswords slashed through the void simultaneously, causing silver-white light to erupt around the entangled Lovia and the Dark Angel Sasrir. \n The palace shrouded in grim shadows suddenly brightened, and a huge ball of light filled with holy flames appeared out of thin air, enveloping the Dark Angel and Lovia within it, rapidly dissolving them and igniting their flesh. \n \"Sunlight\"! \n In this brilliant radiance, Lovia's pair of light gray eyes revealed substantial pain, and her voice echoed in a phantom and ethereal manner: \n \"I did not betray the City of Silver...\" \n \n —— Volume 6 \"Light Chaser\", Chapter 113, The Final Guard",
    ["【B占位】克莱恩坐下，进入冥想。黑暗中，他看到一个绝望的中年男人撕碎了欠债的账单，洒向空中。\n纵火犯：我……我什么都没有了！"] = "[Placeholder B] Klein sits down and enters meditation. In the darkness, he sees a desperate middle-aged man tearing up his debt bills and scattering them into the air. \nPyromaniac: I... I have nothing left!",
